From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 23:32:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] vbscript: IActiveScript threads, interrupt, clone, type
 libraries, scriptlets, IDispatchEx members, text attributes (3209)

Implements the vbscript gap items: IActiveScriptError::GetSourceLineText;
IActiveScript::AddTypeLib (constants of enumerations and modules are global
names; persistent libraries survive a reset), GetCurrentScriptThreadID,
GetScriptThreadID, GetScriptThreadState, InterruptScriptThread (an abort is
not resumed by On Error Resume Next, SCRIPTINTERRUPT_RAISEEXCEPTION raises a
normal error), Clone, SetScriptState(DISCONNECTED); AddScriptlet (procedure
named after the event, bound through IBindEventHandler);
IActiveScriptDebug text attributes; IDispatchEx of class instances
(GetTypeInfo with function, property and field descriptions, GetIDsOfNames,
GetDispID flags, DeleteMember*, GetMemberProperties/Name, GetNextDispID) and
of the script scope (function invoke flags, constants, array elements,
DeleteMember*, GetMemberProperties/Name, GetNextDispID); Is on non-objects
(424), assignment to constants and procedures (501), calling a non-array
variable, a variable as a statement, Err = value, GetObject(path, class),
For Each over arrays of records, SubMatches/Match2/MatchCollection2 type
info and enumerators.

Gate fastvbb1 (64 and 32 bit), 36 mutants SG_MUTANT_VBB1_* each shown to
fail it. vbscript conformance tests 64 and 32 bit: 0 failures.

